<p style="text-align: center;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1689" src="https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright.png" alt="ghostfaceandcopyright" width="452" height="298" srcset="https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright.png 452w, https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright-300x198.png 300w, https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright-24x16.png 24w, https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright-36x24.png 36w, https://www.ghostface.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/ghostfaceandcopyright-48x32.png 48w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px" />Logo Facts: Fans may have noticed that the new logo with Ghostface has him being left Handed..</p>
